; NGSI-LD Scope (ETSI GS CIM 009 v1.9.1, section 4.18).
;
; Hierarchical slash-separated path of Name-like labels, plus the special
; `urn:ngsi-ld:null` tombstone used to mark a deleted scope.

Scope           = "urn:ngsi-ld:null" / ["/"] ScopeLevel *("/" ScopeLevel)
ScopeLevel      = unicodeLetter *ScopeLevelChar
ScopeLevelChar  = unicodeNumber / unicodeLetter / %x5F   ; _ (underscore)
